1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
In 1916, Albert Einstein predicted ripples in the fabric of spacetime known as gravitational waves.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:10,800
A century later,

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:16,000
LIGO observed ripples caused by two colliding black holes.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
This discovery opened a brand new window to study the invisible universe.
